{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "trace-ship-commit-test",
    "name": "规范提交助手 - AI 接口测试",
    "description": "测试 AI 接口连通性，验证 404/401/200 响应。导入后先检查环境变量 baseUrl / apiKey / model。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 OpenAI 兼容路径（插件当前逻辑）",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"{{model}}\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"{{prompt}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.3,\n  \"stream\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        },
        "description": "与插件当前请求完全一致。若返回 404，说明 baseUrl 不应带 /anthropic 后缀，或该服务不支持 OpenAI 兼容协议。"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "02 直接 /v1/chat/completions（无 anthropic 后缀）",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"{{model}}\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"{{prompt}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.3,\n  \"stream\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.minimaxi.com/v1/chat/completions",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "minimaxi",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        },
        "description": "去掉 /anthropic 后缀，直接请求根域名的 OpenAI 兼容路径。"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Anthropic /v1/messages 协议",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "anthropic-version",
            "value": "2023-06-01"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"{{model}}\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 2048,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"{{prompt}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.minimaxi.com/anthropic/v1/messages",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "minimaxi",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "anthropic",
            "v1",
            "messages"
          ]
        },
        "description": "如果该代理提供 Anthropic 原生协议，用这个请求测试。Claude Code 大概率走的就是这条路径。"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "console.log('请求 URL:', pm.request.url.toString());",
          "console.log('请求 Body:', pm.request.body?.toString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://api.minimaxi.com/anthropic",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "插件会自动在其后拼接 /v1/chat/completions"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "你的 API 密钥"
    },
    {
      "key": "model",
      "value": "MiniMax-M2.7",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "prompt",
      "value": "你是一个专业的代码提交助手。请根据以下 git diff 信息，生成完全符合规范的 commit 信息。\n\n## Commit 规范格式（必须严格遵循）：\n\n变更类型：\n□ 无配置项改动 □ 有配置项改动\n\n更新内容：\n[A 为功能增加 F 为 BUG 修复]：\n\n1. A [具体功能描述]\n2. F [具体修复描述]\n\n配置项改动[详见相关软件配置文件管理]：\n无\n\n关联性改动[选填]：\nPXX板卡硬件版本:\n信号子模块硬件版本:\n控制子模块硬件版本:\n后台服务程序版本:\n场景管理程序版本:\n数学仿真软件版本:\n轨迹仿真软件版本:\n采集回放仪信号处理软件版本:\n采集回放仪数据管理软件版本:\n采集回放仪通信控制软件版本:\n采集回放仪板载显控软件版本:\n采集回放仪人机显控软件版本:\n导航增强上位机软件版本:\n信号单元后台软件版本:\n基准单元后台软件版本:\n信号单元数学仿真软件版本:\n信号单元硬件程序版本:\n基准单元硬件程序版本:\n阵列天线采集卡软件版本:\n阵列天线时钟加权软件版本:\n阵列天线系统加权软件版本:\n阵列天线信号转发软件版本:\n阵列天线上位机软件版本:\n\n## Git Diff 内容：\n+ 示例新增行\n- 示例删除行\n\n请生成符合上述规范的 commit 信息。",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
